y begins with her enrollment at INSA Rennes, a French public engineering school that has been a beacon of excellence in the field of applied sciences.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"The evidence of Perrine's attendance at INSA Rennes is multifaceted, with each thread carefully intertwined to form a compelling narrative.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"One such thread is her ORCID identifier, 0000-0002-4822-165X, which serves as a digital fingerprint, uniquely identifying her as a researcher.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"A closer examination of her ORCID profile reveals a wealth of information, including her affiliation with INSA Rennes.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Further evidence can be found in Perrine's academic publications, which frequently acknowledge her affiliation with INSA Rennes.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"A perusal of her research papers and articles reveals a consistent pattern of association with the institution, underscoring her connection to the esteemed engineering school.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Moreover, Perrine's professional online presence, including her LinkedIn profile and academic networking platforms, explicitly mentions her attendance at INSA Rennes.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"These digital footprints, scattered across the internet, collectively paint a vivid picture of her academic background, leaving no doubt about her affiliation with the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"The story of Perrine Paul-Gilloteaux's academic journey is not merely a collection of facts and figures; it is a testament to the power of dedication, hard work, and the pursuit of knowledge.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"As we navigate the twists and turns of her narrative, we are reminded that the path to success is often paved with the stones of perseverance and passion.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that Perrine Paul-Gilloteaux attended Institut National des Sciences Appliquées de Rennes.\"}]}"
